# Scenario 'mail_server_hidden': the HIDDEN third button of メールサーバ. 7C:7CF6 tests `hJoyHeld xor $24` (exactly SELECT+LEFT held) right
# after the entry メールサーバ of the mail menu was chosen and calls 22:4000 instead of 23:4000; that screen has a third button "かんぜんにけす"
# ("もんだいのあるメールとメールサーバにのこっているすべてのメールをじどうでぜんぶけします"). Flow (fake POP3 server with the five mails):
# the entry is chosen with A and SELECT+LEFT is held right after the A press (A itself must be released: the test wants exactly $24), the
# first-use notice is closed, the third button is chosen, "いいえ" (default) refuses once, then LEFT+A ("はい") runs the deletion: dial, POP3
# session with DELE of everything, result screens. Then the same entry once more with SELECT+LEFT and button 1 (check) to see the modified check.
# Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x5
wait 40
taplen 2
gap 0
tap A                        # メールサーバ
hold SELECT+LEFT 120         # exactly SELECT+LEFT while the state function runs
waitstable 60 max 600
shot notice
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot menu
gap 30
taplen 4
tap DOWN x2
wait 40
tap A                        # かんぜんにけす
waitstable 60 max 600
shot confirm
tap A                        # いいえ (default)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot refused
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot confirm_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1500
shot deleting
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot result_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot result_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot back_in_mail_menu
# --- again with SELECT+LEFT: the second button
taplen 2
gap 0
tap A                        # メールサーバ (cursor already on it after the first entry)
hold SELECT+LEFT 120         # exactly SELECT+LEFT while the state function runs
waitstable 60 max 600
shot notice
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot menu
gap 30
taplen 4
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A                        # じどうでぜんぶけす (hidden variant of the menu)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot auto_confirm
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot auto_deleting
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot auto_result_1
